Subtree-attributed third-party projects
---------------------------------------

CapsuleOS is structured as a Git-subtree monorepo.  The following
projects are vendored as subtrees and remain under their original
licenses.  Their license texts and NOTICE files travel with the
respective subdirectories; consult them directly for the canonical
attribution and copyright statements.

* `bootloader/` — capsule-bootloader
* `kernel/`     — hnx-core
* `tools/ohlink-cc/` — ohlink-format, rustc_codegen_ohlink,
  ohlink-linker

